# egress-hosts: every host the worker (and sync-museums, on the same network) dials outside Cloudflare's
# ranges (A§17.4, P3b Q3). mjk-install installs it as the root-owned /etc/mjk/egress-hosts; mjk-egress
# resolves each name with the host's resolver into table inet mjk's set worker_dst4, the only tcp/443 the
# mjk-egress network has besides cf4. R2 (MJK_R2_ENDPOINT) is not listed: it is in cf4.
# One lower-case name per line. test/egress-hosts.test.ts holds this list equal to the hosts in the code.
# A change takes effect when mjk-install runs (it refills the set), at the latest at the next mjk-tick.

# The museum sources (P1a) and Wikimedia Commons (P3b, ADR-0018): ALLOWED_HOSTS in
# apps/server/src/museums/sources/http.ts
query.wikidata.org
services.rce.geovoorziening.nl
commons.wikimedia.org
upload.wikimedia.org

# Mail (P2a, ADR-0012): LETTERMINT_URL in apps/server/src/mail/lettermint.ts
api.lettermint.co

# The worker's health pings (A§17.7): HC_PING_ORIGIN in apps/server/src/lib/healthchecks.ts
hc-ping.com

# The basemap tiles (P1d): BUILDS_URL and SOURCE_BASE in apps/server/src/tiles/builds.ts
build-metadata.protomaps.dev
build.protomaps.com
